Universal Robots Client Library Python

This project is a clean Python translation of Universal Robots Client Library
(URCL) 2.14.0, based on upstream commit
91be9eeac2028b0a5ee3654b5d12508cebefc1e6.

The upstream project is:
https://github.com/UniversalRobots/Universal_Robots_Client_Library

